# Daily note

Creates today's journal entry.

```json noam-workflow
{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "daily-note",
  "name": "Daily note",
  "description": "Create today's daily note from the shared template.",
  "variables": [
    {
      "name": "value",
      "label": "Title",
      "type": "text",
      "required": false
    }
  ],
  "requires": {
    "templates": [
      "Templates/Daily.md"
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "type": "create-note",
      "path": "Journal/{{date:YYYY-MM-DD}}.md",
      "template": "Templates/Daily.md",
      "onExists": "open",
      "open": true
    }
  ]
}
```
